hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"955","Salam bin Junada and Muhammad bin Yahya bin Dharis narrated to us, saying: Abu Muawiyah narrated to us, Asim, on the authority of Ikrimah, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, He said: “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, traveled and stayed for nineteen days, praying two rak’ahs.” Ibn Abbas said: We pray We prayed two rak'ahs between us and nineteen days, and if we stayed in prayer longer than that, we prayed four. Ibn Dhurais said: On the authority of Asim"
